er the governing named census instant for that line is a specific instant inside the interval is NOT established on the filed record — **the command-8 assignment is left UNRESOLVED under HQ's deferral** rather than asserted. Independently of the assignment, the A13 receipt defect stands (an index line claiming evidence the filing does not contain). The command's text needs no change; VALIDATION of its filed outputs is part of the HQ deferral in §9b.1.
